sequenceDiagram
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails<br/>Orchestrator
    participant BuiltIn as Built-in Detector<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant HF as HuggingFace Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Judge as LLM Judge Detector<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant vLLM as vLLM Inference Server<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant MinIO as MinIO Storage<br/>9000/TCP S3

    Note over HF,MinIO: Startup: Model Loading
    HF->>MinIO: S3 GetObject (model artifacts)<br/>aws-connection secret
    MinIO-->>HF: Transformer model files<br/>loaded into memory

    Note over Orchestrator,BuiltIn: Flow 1: Built-in Detection (regex/file-type)
    Orchestrator->>BuiltIn: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Note right of BuiltIn: Local processing:<br/>regex patterns,<br/>file-type validation,<br/>custom detectors
    BuiltIn-->>Orchestrator: ContentAnalysisResponse<br/>detections[] with scores

    Note over Orchestrator,HF: Flow 2: HuggingFace Detection (ML inference)
    Orchestrator->>HF: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Note right of HF: Local inference:<br/>AutoModelForSequenceClassification<br/>or GraniteForCausalLM
    HF-->>Orchestrator: ContentAnalysisResponse<br/>detections[] with scores

    Note over Orchestrator,vLLM: Flow 3: LLM Judge Detection (delegated evaluation)
    Orchestrator->>Judge: POST /api/v1/text/contents<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Judge->>vLLM: HTTP evaluation request<br/>via vllm-judge library<br/>VLLM_BASE_URL
    Note right of vLLM: LLM evaluates content<br/>against metric<br/>(safety/toxicity/accuracy)
    vLLM-->>Judge: Evaluation result<br/>decision + score + reasoning
    Judge-->>Orchestrator: ContentAnalysisResponse<br/>detections[] with scores

    Note over Orchestrator,Judge: Flow 4: LLM Judge Generation Detection
    Orchestrator->>Judge: POST /api/v1/text/generation<br/>Content-Type: application/json
    Judge->>vLLM: HTTP evaluation request<br/>via vllm-judge library
    vLLM-->>Judge: Evaluation result
    Judge-->>Orchestrator: ContentAnalysisResponse

    Note over BuiltIn,Judge: Observability
    BuiltIn-->>BuiltIn: GET /metrics<br/>prometheus_client multi-process
    Judge-->>Judge: GET /api/v1/metrics<br/>prometheus-fastapi-instrumentator
